-- A call script for examples/selfenv.lang (S7 s2, Q-S7-6 (a)). The env line
-- gives the contract address of each call: the receiver address of
-- test/evmchain.sh, thus test/evm.sh reads the same value with ADDRESS.
env 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
1 1u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb stamp
2 2u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb onlyAt 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
3 3u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb onlyAt 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000c1
